      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُؤَمَّلٌ</span></b>  One <i>whose beneficence may be hoped for.</i>
(Har p. 183.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">المُؤَمَّلُ</span> <i>The eighth of the horses
that are started together in a race;</i> (K;) these
being ten: (TA:) or <i>the ninth thereof:</i> (TA in
explanation of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">السُّكَيْتُ</span>:) or <i>the seventh thereof.</i>
(Ham p. 46.) ＝   
